                "label": "Description",
                "content": "An injured butterfly is shown lying in the middle of a stretcher carried by two butterflies (one on the left and one right). Another butterfly walks beside the butterfly carrying the stretcher on the right. A small butterfly with a parasol or umbrella flies above the injured butterfly. The area underneath the ground they walk on is shown at the bottom of the composition, and the words \"LE BLESSÉ\" are printed in black at the bottom center. The plate is not signed or numbered."
